#. ~ Description of monster "feral slider"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Every time you blink, this debris-wielding feral is in a different place.  "
"They are always in motion without actually crossing the intervening space."
msgstr ""

