#. ~ Description of monster "eater"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A thicket of opalescent, faintly-glowing diaphanous fronds, lazily waving in "
"the air, with parts of them constantly vanishing and reappearing.  The "
"central core, if it exists, is obscured by their constant motion.  There are "
"no obvious sensory organs, but as you approach the motion of the fronds "
"changes slightly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "eater"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The eater's fronds lazily drift to and fro."
msgstr ""

