#. ~ Description of monster "triffid seedseer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
msgid ""
"A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered "
"stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  "
"You have the distinct sense that it's watching you."
msgstr ""

